msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:80
#: 0883ce2becb147fbb8cc026cfa7c9012
msgid "The default RC input is configured on the UART6. The SBUS pin is inverted and connected to RX6. Non SBUS, single wire serial inputs can be directly tied to RX6 if SBUS pin is left unconnected. RC could  be applied instead at a different UART port such as UART1, UART4 or UART8, and set the protocol to receive RC data: ``SERIALn_PROTOCOL=23`` and change SERIAL5 _Protocol to something other than '23'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:83
#: 3184fe3141bf4a2f9d54f4165037ed32
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:85
#: 7d1a14eb48084f20ac22b4fa4f9098cc
msgid "The MicoAir743 supports onboard OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver). Simultaneously, DisplayPort HD OSD is enabled by default and available on the HD VTX connector, See below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:88
#: 55ed62c3d844469cb50190f73031965d
msgid "VTX Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:90
#: c9fede17097248f48eab03604a458f2c
msgid "The SH1.0-6P connector supports a DJI Air Unit / HD VTX connection. Protocol defaults to DisplayPort. Pin 1 of the connector is 9v so be careful not to connect this to a peripheral requiring 5v."
msgstr ""

